OL,3,ANo 10 insists RAF Fairford is safe
OL,4,Aafter US withdraws bombers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Number 10 spokesperson said he would
OL,7,Fnot comment on "foreign nations'
OL,8,Fmilitary operations", but said the base
OL,9,Fwas safe, and pointed to US President
OL,10,FDonald Trump's comments last week,
OL,11,Fwhere he "praised our police, defence
OL,12,Fand security services" in relation to
OL,13,Fthe base.
